SELECT ?movie ?movieLabel (COUNT(DISTINCT ?radaActor) AS ?radaActors) (COUNT(DISTINCT ?actor) AS ?totalActors) (COUNT(DISTINCT ?radaActor) * 100.0 / COUNT(DISTINCT ?actor) AS ?percentage) WHERE {
  ?movie wdt:[property:instance of] wd:[entity:film] .
  ?movie wdt:[property:cast member] ?actor .
  OPTIONAL {
    ?actor wdt:[property:educated at] wd:[entity:Royal Academy of Dramatic Art] .
    BIND(?actor AS ?radaActor)
  }
  SERVICE wikibase:label { bd:serviceParam wikibase:language "en". }
}
GROUP BY ?movie ?movieLabel
HAVING (COUNT(DISTINCT ?radaActor) > 0)
ORDER BY DESC(?percentage)
LIMIT 100

